  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BlockStack v2.0.5\n\nWEB4 OASIS API BlockStack OASIS Provider is one of the many WEB2/WEB3 providers that plug in and integtate into the OASIS.\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Implement bounded Stacks principal CQL source with exact tip and precision (1433151)\n- Return real Zcash keys and Stacks c32check addresses (a679a74)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BlockStackOASIS",
